From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:30:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Trabis: "All as one PDF" under the receipt strip (month,
 income or expenses)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Button under Belege in both tabs builds one PDF with every receipt/invoice of
  the month on screen: cover page, then each document (images as they are, every
  page of PDFs) with a caption line. Separate from the accountant package.
- Reuses the attached-invoices PDF builder; images that are not JPEG/PNG (SVG,
  WebP, …) are rasterised first, and the PDF text is always German.
- CHANGES_FOR_BACKEND.md: step 10.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WrSmbPeJ9qpSAgv9M15c7v
